{"id": 46, "ts": 1780412560.0194259, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 3, "agent": "james_carter", "message": "I remain in favour of Candidate\u202fC. As Sarah highlighted, his ability to make correct decisions quickly, stay calm in a crisis, and understand complicated technology directly addresses our core needs for stress resilience, decision quality, and technical competence on long\u2011distance flights. However, I share the concern that his difficulty communicating ideas, egocentric attitude, and lack of willingness to pursue further education could undermine crew cooperation and adaptability\u2014both critical for safe international operations. Compared with Candidate\u202fB, whose strong conscientiousness and stress handling are offset by his nasty remarks toward colleagues and a weak memory for numbers, I judge C\u2019s strengths in decisive, calm performance outweigh his interpersonal gaps, especially if we can provide targeted communication coaching. Therefore, I continue to recommend Candidate\u202fC, pending a plan to address his teamwork and development needs."}
